      "message": "refactor(ui): view cube, marker and axis inks are theme tokens\n\nThe view cube, its nav buttons, the corner hint, the playback marker\nand the axis triad took their inks from colour literals in\nground_ink::cube_ink, chosen by the viewport ground. The cube's hover\ndot and the machined facet's hover used one gold literal. Twelve tokens\nnow carry them, each a theme-file key. The dark and light tables hold\nthe old dark-ground and light-ground sets, so no pixel changes.\n\nA theme file that turns the viewport ground light on the dark base (or\ndark on the light base) takes the omitted keys from the built-in table\nof that ground, as the cube did before.\n\nThe colour-literal guard loses the ground_ink.rs and viewcube.rs rows;\nshell.rs goes from 9 to 7.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
