      "message": "refactor(ui): viewport overlay inks are theme tokens\n\nThe generate progress panel, the file drop hint, the empty-view text,\nthe pick halo, the fixture plate marks and the selected G-code move\ndrew with colour literals. Ten tokens now carry them, each a theme-file\nkey. Both tables keep the old values, so no pixel changes. The origin\ntriad outline reads the existing handle_shade (the same 170 black).\npick_ink.rs reads pick_halo too.\n\nThe colour-literal guard loses the rows of gen_overlay.rs, file_drop.rs\nand shell.rs. The viewport overlay family of #1120 is done.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
